# Assisted room106 clear -> natural room120 entry -> five real DK pickups,
# swimming to the real tape, normal clear, console reset and File A re-entry.
# Coordinate/invulnerability fixtures do not write coins, saved flags, goals,
# riding, messages, level-script state, event data or SRAM.
# Room106 chase-Yoshi clear: invulnerability and one X/velocity alignment
# fixture near the final wall. Riding, level-script state, messages, goal timer,
# completion, events and SRAM are never written. No imported state.
# Repeated jump edges also dismiss the actual success message once it opens.
wait 600
dump title
press start 2
wait 180
dump files
press start 2
wait 900
dump intro
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
poke 0109 00

